capabilities","c":[]},{"h":"Compact 1U rack-mount design","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 01 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The KingType GPT-C213V 3-Port GPON OLT is a high-performance Optical Line Terminal (OLT) designed for FTTH (Fiber to the Home), FTTB (Fiber to the Building), FTTO, and enterprise fiber access networks. It is an ideal solution for Internet Service Providers (ISPs), telecom operators, and organizations seeking a reliable, scalable, and cost-effective GPON access platform.</p><p><br></p><p>Featuring 3 GPON PON ports, the KingType GPT-C213V delivers stable, high-speed optical transmission with efficient bandwidth allocation and centralized network management. The OLT supports advanced Layer 2 networking features, enabling seamless deployment for residential, commercial, and enterprise broadband services.</p><p><br></p><p>With support for OMCI-based ONU management, VLAN, QoS, IGMP Snooping, ACL, DHCP Relay, and multiple management interfaces including Web GUI, CLI, SNMP, and Telnet, the GPT-C213V simplifies network operation while ensuring high availability and secure service delivery.</p><p><br></p><p>Whether you're deploying a new fiber network or expanding an existing GPON infrastructure, the KingType GPT-C213V provides carrier-grade performance, long-term reliability, and flexible network scalability.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>3 GPON PON Ports</li><li>GPON Downstream Speed up to 2.488 Gbps</li><li>GPON Upstream Speed up to 1.244 Gbps</li><li>Supports FTTH, FTTB, FTTO, and ISP deployments</li><li>OMCI-based ONU auto-discovery and remote management</li><li>Advanced Layer 2 switching capabilities</li><li>Supports VLAN, QoS, ACL, DHCP Relay, and IGMP Snooping</li><li>Web GUI, CLI, SNMP, and Telnet management</li><li>Carrier-grade security and traffic management</li><li>Compact 1U rack-mount design</li><li>Stable, reliable, and energy-efficient operation</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"VSOL V1600G1-B 8 Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g1-b-8-port-gpon-olt","now":"125,000৳","old":"128,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600GS-F Single PON GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600gs-f-single-pon-gpon-olt","now":"33,000৳","old":"35,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600GT 2-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600gt-2-port-gpon-olt","now":"54,000৳","old":"57,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600G2-B 16-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g2-b-16-port-gpon-olt","now":"226,000৳","old":"230,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600G0-B 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g0-b-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"87,000৳","old":"89,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM Scalable 8 port with 4 PON port E08GPS-2S+ GPON OLT","href":"/ecom-scalable-8-port-with-4-pon-port-e08gps-2s-gpon-olt","now":"68,000৳","old":"71,300৳","single":""},{"name":"HSGQ-G08L 8-Port GPON OLT","href":"/hsgq-g08l-8-port-gpon-olt","now":"105,000৳","old":"108,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HSGQ-G04L 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/hsgq-g04l-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"71,000৳","old":"73,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM E01GP-S+ 1-PON Port GPON OLT","href":"/ecom-e01gp-s-1-pon-port-gpon-olt","now":"","old":"","single":"28,000৳"},{"name":"KingType GPT-C224V 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/kingtype-gpt-c224v-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/kingtype-gpna11-gpon-onu","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/GPNA11/KingType%20GPNA11%20GPON%20ONU%20P1-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"KingType GPNA11 GPON ONU","width":100,"height":100},"name":"KingType GPNA11 GPON ONU","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳","tax":"Ex T